        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2585]\nIf the CPS sub-CA1 certificate or CPS sub-CA2 certificate or CPS leaf certificate contains both CRLDistributionPoints and AuthorityInfoAccess extensions, the relying party may process just one or both or none as per the local policy of the relying party.",
